Package: hfofi
Title: Order-Flow Imbalance on Intraday Market-Book Data (Academic Exercise)
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Factors (spread, microprice, imbalance, VOI, OFI, OFI-N), predictive regressions and an
    OFI-N backtest with costs and an in-sample/out-of-sample split. Rendered with rmarkdown.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports: conflicted, tidyverse, dplyr, tibble, tidyr, purrr, ggplot2, scales, lubridate, patchwork, RcppRoll, rmarkdown, knitr, jsonlite
Suggests: paletteer
